# MMOSkillMasteryPack - quest titles + flavor, currency names, and other display text.
# Keys are bare; Hytale's I18nModule prepends the filename, so each loads as
# mmoskilltree.<key> and the mod resolves it by convention (quest.<id>.title / .flavor,
# currency.<id>.name, shop.<id>.title / .desc, ...). Add a <locale>/mmoskilltree.lang with
# the same keys to translate; missing keys fall back to English per key.

# --- Quests (quest.<id>.title / .flavor, resolved by convention; matches the bounty pattern) ---
quest.meet_the_mastery_trainer.title = A Word with the Trainer
quest.meet_the_mastery_trainer.flavor = There's somebody else down here you should meet. They teach mastery. Cross the landing and say hello.
quest.mastery_tribute.title = The Trainer's Due
quest.mastery_tribute.flavor = Bring me essence and a few linen scraps, and put down some beasts on the way. I will give you something worth the walk. What, I could not tell you.
quest.pack_first_milestone.title = The First Milestone
quest.pack_first_milestone.flavor = Bring any one of your skills up to its first milestone, then come back to me. That is where my teaching starts.
quest.pack_essence_collector.title = Essence Collector
quest.pack_essence_collector.flavor = Bring me Essence of Life. I turn it into mastery, a little at a time.
quest.pack_essence_devotee.title = Essence Devotee
quest.pack_essence_devotee.flavor = You have brought me essence before. This time, bring me a sackful.
quest.pack_path_of_mastery.title = Many Trades
quest.pack_path_of_mastery.flavor = One good skill is not enough for what I teach. Raise several of them a long way, then come back to me.
quest.pack_mastery_tithe.title = Mastery Tithe
quest.pack_mastery_tithe.flavor = The mastery codex takes a tithe of blood and timber. Put down a few creatures and chop a few logs.
quest.mastery_tithe_credit.title = What You Already Paid
quest.mastery_tithe_credit.flavor = I kept count of every tithe you sent me. Come and find me in the Forgotten Temple, and we will settle what all of it is worth now.
quest.mastery_lesson_week.title = A Week of Lessons
quest.mastery_lesson_week.flavor = Do my lessons through the week and come back to me once you have a handful done. A missed day or two will not cost you the week.

# --- The Mastery Trainer's lessons (board contracts; quest.<id>.title / .flavor) ---
quest.mmo_lesson_timber.title = Felling Practice
quest.mmo_lesson_timber.flavor = A steady swing is the first thing I teach. Go out and fell trees until your arms know the work without asking.
quest.mmo_lesson_ore.title = Seam Work
quest.mmo_lesson_ore.flavor = Find a seam of ore and work it until the rock gives nothing more. A miner who stops at the easy stone learns nothing from it.
quest.mmo_lesson_fishing.title = Rod and Line
quest.mmo_lesson_fishing.flavor = Take a rod to the water and wait. Patience is a discipline too, and most people who come down here have none of it.
quest.mmo_lesson_hunt.title = Hunting Drill
quest.mmo_lesson_hunt.flavor = Go out past the temple steps and put down whatever comes at you. Any creature will do, as long as you come back on your own feet.
quest.mmo_lesson_abilities.title = Ability Drills
quest.mmo_lesson_abilities.flavor = Your abilities are skills like any other, and skills rust. Use them out in the world until they come without thinking.
quest.mmo_lesson_crafting.title = Bench Practice
quest.mmo_lesson_crafting.flavor = Make things. Anything at all, at any bench you like. Hands that only swing and dig forget how to build.
quest.mmo_lesson_workshop.title = Workshop Hours
quest.mmo_lesson_workshop.flavor = Put in a long stretch at the benches. Crafting is a skill like the rest, and I want to see it grow before you come back.
quest.mmo_lesson_hard_timber.title = Heavy Felling
quest.mmo_lesson_hard_timber.flavor = You know how to swing an axe by now. Clear a whole stand of trees this time, and keep going when your shoulders start to complain.
quest.mmo_lesson_hard_hunt.title = The Long Hunt
quest.mmo_lesson_hard_hunt.flavor = A longer hunt this time. Stay out until the creatures stop coming, then stay a while longer.
quest.mmo_lesson_hard_study.title = Hard Study
quest.mmo_lesson_hard_study.flavor = Train whatever skill you like, but train it hard. I will know from the look of you whether you did.
quest.mmo_lesson_master_ore.title = Deep Seams
quest.mmo_lesson_master_ore.flavor = Go down to the deepest seams you can reach and work them dry. A master does not leave good ore in the rock.
quest.mmo_lesson_master_hunt.title = Master's Hunt
quest.mmo_lesson_master_hunt.flavor = Hunt the way a master hunts, from first light until the light is gone. Whatever is out there, put it down and keep moving.
quest.mmo_lesson_master_study.title = Master's Study
quest.mmo_lesson_master_study.flavor = Pick any skill and push it further than you think it goes. A master's lesson should leave you tired, and a little proud.

